      "boundary_rule": "Project Center owns only project-and-counterparty context collection and dispatch; financing loan owns contractor borrowing, expense claim owns deduction registration, and Finance Center exclusively owns approval, completion and accounting consequences.",
      "forbidden_drift": "Do not persist borrowing or deduction facts in the workspace, let frontend choose a fact model, let project roles complete financial facts, or create another project-local borrowing/deduction model.",
      "decision": "Use one transient P1 orchestration entry to dispatch into two canonical fact models; keep all business state and downstream projections under their existing owners.",
      "formal_product_layer": "P1",
